<text x="147.32" y="190.5" size="1.778" layer="94">8i-00054</text>
<text x="40.64" y="190.5" size="1.778" layer="94">8i-00054</text>
<text x="152.4" y="251.46" size="1.778" layer="94">For the ka8i the I/O strobe delay line tap is changed from pin F12T2 to F12V2 to increace delay to 0.5us.</text>
<text x="137.16" y="175.26" size="1.778" layer="94">* To be installed with the first mm8ia only.</text>
<text x="154.94" y="185.42" size="1.778" layer="94" rot="R180">*</text>
<text x="38.1" y="187.96" size="1.778" layer="94" rot="R180">*</text>
<text x="152.4" y="248.92" size="1.778" layer="94">This may be an issue for non-wire-wrap-backplanes.</text>
</plain>
